@startuml
title Launch Manager - Supervision Failure

autonumber "<b>[00]"

participant "Launch Manager" as LM
participant "OS (kernel)" as kernel

participant "app1" as app1

activate LM
activate app1

...

note over LM,app1
Run Target "Running" successfully active
end note

LM -> LM: Detected supervision failure of app1

LM -> kernel: SIGKILL app1
kernel -> app1: terminate
destroy app1

kernel -> LM: Process app1 terminated.

LM -> LM: Determine recovery action

ref over LM
The subsequent behavior is identical to the process crash scenario.
end ref

@enduml
